{"repositoryId":1078723667,"availability":"available","full":"victorfu/ollie-reader","name":"ollie-reader","description":"For Ollie Studying Only","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2025-10-18T09:32:03Z","updated":"2026-10-17T05:23:41Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://ollie-reader.web.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://ollie-reader.web.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T19:17:05.227Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T19:17:05.227Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T19:17:05.227Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T11:46:04.623Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T19:17:05.227Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An AI-assisted English-learning workspace for reading, listening, speaking, practice, and games.","Ollie Reader is a responsive, authentication-gated web app for Chinese-speaking English learners. It combines a PDF learning workspace with bilingual Gemini assistance, vocabulary review, speech and sentence practice, exam practice, transcripts, audio uploads, and games.","The UI follows macOS Human Interface Guidelines adapted for the web: a collapsible desktop source list, mobile drawer navigation, hairline borders, restrained translucent surfaces, light/dark themes, and touch-friendly controls. The app can be installed as a PWA. Built assets are precached, while exam images, Google Fonts, and bundled transcripts use targeted runtime caches; cloud-backed features still require their services."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/victorfu/ollie-reader/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"3bc61632b1a64266ddf53ac2bde6704d1df7f9a09bb31bb693a09483a2966a06","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:04.768Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:04.768Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An AI-assisted English-learning workspace for reading, listening, speaking, practice, and games.","sourceUrl":"https://g